  "notes": "door_stems (docs/door_stems.md): source 'door_wood_open', rebuilt from stems of a CC0 recording (THIRD_PARTY.md). One real gesture by default. Variation remixes the real stems (a different stored take where the recording has several); nothing is averaged, bands are not pitch-shifted (size is tape speed), and there is no freeze, time-squeeze or added smoothing."
